   "body_md": "## Setlist highlights\n\n- **One Kind Favor**: earliest performance in the archive; rare: 8 archived performances [3]\n- **Mindbender**: rare: 4 archived performances [3]\n- Earliest performances in the archive: Viola Lee Blues [3]\n\n## The recordings\n\n- **gd1966-01-01.178957.sbd.matthews.minches.miller.flac1648** (recommended): soundboard; 4 songs; 17 min [1]\n- **gd1966-01-01.178956.sbd.matthews.minches.miller.flac2496**: soundboard; 4 songs; 17 min [2]\n\n## Tapers and lineage\n\n- **gd1966-01-01.178957.sbd.matthews.minches.miller.flac1648**: taped by Bob Matthews collection; transferred by Transfer and Tagging by David Minches Mastering by Charlie Miller  August 27, 2026; source: SBD > Reel (Scotch 201 7\" reel 7.5ips) [1]. Also: The box holding the tape was labeled 'Jerry Foster'; no further information about it has surfaced; Uploader believes this is a master tape or taken directly from the master [1]\n- **gd1966-01-01.178956.sbd.matthews.minches.miller.flac2496**: taped by Bob Matthews collection; transferred by Transfer and Tagging by David Minches Mastering by Charlie Miller  August 27, 2026; source: SBD > Reel (Scotch 201 7\" reel 7.5ips) [2]",
